\f0\fs24 \cf2 <$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 Fridge Force didn\'92t need a Washing Machine; they were technological generations ahead of anything Project Kebab could conceive, design, fear and argue about. Their Mobile Stasis Energy System (MoSES) required no contraption bolted to a floor in a research lab, no elliptical rail, and no travelling monkey arms. Drones could fly in arcs,\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
 rings and ellipses and arrange themselves into geometries describable only by a small number of Fridge Force multi-dimensional physicists who had stopped being invited to normal parties. And they could \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 carry a mechanism to spin a Gyges disc.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
<!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f1\fs22 What Chip Stockwell had identified as an unacceptable risk for Project Kebab was a finely tuned capability for Fridge Force. Where Project Kebab might cause unpredictable earthquakes and tremors, Fridge Force could precisely excite multi-universal dimensions to disrupt three-dimensional matter in targeted locations to varying degrees of scale and intensity.\
It took ten or so seconds for the drones to read the target while they orbited around a focal point a few metres above the shaft head. They made minor horizontal and vertical adjustments from their elliptical locus as they accelerated like a flywheel to blurring speeds. The leaves of trees and ferns around the site quivered from a breeze that came straight down at them.\
It was sudden, precise, and somewhat anticlimactic; rock cracked, and metal cried out as it was wrenched. Things scraped and wailed. It was brief. When the shaft head exploded, there was more of a puff than a blow, and the bushland vegetation that had been leaning away from the trauma found it had suffered only superficial injury.\
The pentad rushed into the shaft in single file.\
A few minutes later, a second pentad reached the shaft and entered without hesitation. For the time being, \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 the swarm of remaining Fridge Force drones retreated.\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl220\sb220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 <!$Scr_Ps::1><$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 The two pentads made similar journeys, through a series of air-conditioning shafts and ducts, which they navigated easily, the second benefitting from the exploration of the first. They found their way to the concourse at the Sublime Point end of the Traverse, where they collected data of the crater, the carved walls, the flipped Traverse pod and the twisted rail for evidence of the Elvi\'92s Gyges disc abuse. They flew down the tunnel faster than Traverse pod speed and emerged onto the Ruined Castle concourse where they made their own surveys, then took to different corridors.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

